%description:

Tcp.abortRstWithAck:rfc -- the RST of an abort comes without the ACK bit.

The claim (Tcp.ned): "true: the RST of an abort carries the ACK bit and RCV.NXT, as Linux
(tcp_send_active_reset()); false: <SEQ=SND.NXT><CTL=RST> of RFC 9293".

The classes: rfc (false, the default) and linux (true, the value of LinuxTcp). The code:
TcpConnection::sendAbortRst() sends <SEQ=SND.NXT><CTL=RST>, or with true a RST with the ACK bit
and RCV.NXT. This test separates "rfc" from the other value.

Host under test: host1, whose TcpTestApp connects to host2 at 0.1 s and aborts the connection
at 0.5 s. Observation: level 1, the RST of host1 comes without the ACK bit.

%# parameter: Tcp.abortRstWithAck
%# class: rfc
%# value: false
%# key: *.host1.tcp.abortRstWithAck
%# expected-result: PASS

%includes:
#include "ProtocolTest.h"
#include "TcpTestApp.h"

%global:

using namespace inet;
using namespace inet::protocoltest;

Define_ProtocolTestProgram()
{
    return ProtocolTest("TcpAbortRstWithAckRfc")
        .act(action().at(0.1).run<TcpTestApp>("host1.app[0]", [](TcpTestApp& app) { app.socket().connect(app.addressOf("host2"), 1000); })
                 .describe("host1 connects to host2"))
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetReceivedFromLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.synBit == true && tcp.ackBit == true")
             .capture("peerIsn", "tcp.sequenceNo")
             .describe("the SYN-ACK of host2")
             .within(0.5))
        .act(action().at(0.5).run<TcpTestApp>("host1.app[0]", [](TcpTestApp& app) { app.socket().abort(); })
                 .describe("host1 aborts the connection"))
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetSentToLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.rstBit == true")
             .first()
                  .assertPacket("tcp.ackBit == false")
             .describe("the RST of host1")
             .within(0.1));
}

%activity:
EV << "TcpAbortRstWithAckRfc compiled\n";

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
*.host1.tcp.abortRstWithAck = false    # the parameter under test
*.host1.app[0].typename = "TcpTestApp"
include ../../parameter/ini/_bulk.ini
include ../../parameter/ini/_base.ini

%contains: stdout
PROTOCOLTEST TcpAbortRstWithAckRfc: PASS
